Cell["\<\
X  now  contains the commuting pair id\[CloseCurlyQuote]s of (g^{2i},hg^j) \
for Co1. We lift them to Co0, and find the SL2Z orbits containing them. It \
turns out that there are only two:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b672bd97-82f3-4626-a11c-dbfcfeaa69d3"],

